  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 04/08/2026, the continued use of '52 St Stephens Road, Hounslow, TW3 2BQ' as a mixed sui generis use property comprising of part Ground Floor Flat 1, part Ground Floor Flat 2, and Second Floor Flat 3 as self-contained residential units, together with a first-floor House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) comprising four single-occupancy rooms, as shown on the submitted existing floor plan in DWG 0001 V2, was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe evidence supplied is sufficient to establish that, on the balance of probabilities, the property  at '52 St Stephens Road, Hounslow, TW3 2BQ' has been used as a mixed sui generis use comprising of part Ground Floor Flat 1, part Ground Floor Flat 2, and Second Floor Flat 3 as self-contained residential units, together with a first-floor House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) comprising four single-occupancy rooms, as shown on the submitted existing floor plan in DWG 0001 V2, for an uninterrupted period of at least ten years from the date of application, and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n"
  ],
